{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p023a","title":"司马师群臣请立曹髦奉法驾迎公","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p023a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"司马师群臣请立曹髦奉法驾迎公","evidence":["shaodi-e-p023a-q"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-7cfde7c197276c911172","label":"正文","text":"嘉平六年王肃持节兼太常奉法驾迎高贵乡公于元城","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2075dcee19897f7496b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0038","role":"主奏","evidence":["shaodi-e-p023a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0071","role":"奉迎","evidence":["shaodi-e-p023a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0033","role":"奉迎","evidence":["shaodi-e-p023a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0072","role":"奉迎","evidence":["shaodi-e-p023a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0068","role":"被迎立者","evidence":["zhonghua-q-2075dcee19897f7496b4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":254,"label":"曹髦受迎时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y254","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o059","basis":"曹髦受迎时"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-p023a-q","shaodi-q-o059","shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-p023a-q","source_order":[4,306,"P023a"],"order":1126}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0033","name":"王肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0038","name":"司马师","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0068","name":"曹髦","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0071","name":"司马望","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0072","name":"郑袤","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p023a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b16a9dbb51cb501fdf1f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《魏书》曰：“景王复与群臣共奏永宁宫曰：‘臣等闻：人道亲亲，故尊祖；尊祖，故敬宗。礼，大宗无嗣，则择支子之贤者。为人后者，为之子也。东海定王子高贵乡公，文皇帝之孙；宜承正统，以嗣烈祖明皇帝后。率土有赖，万邦幸甚，臣请征公诣洛阳宫。’奏，可。使中护军望，兼太常、河南尹肃，持节，与少府（褒）〔袤〕、尚书亮、侍中表等，奉法驾，迎公于元城。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a571bce205aad8e15394","start":0,"end":171,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：嘉平六年（公元 254）。己丑：旧历初一日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-386affd091adab4ef2df","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o059","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83849af55ebd17291970","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月，己丑〖1〗，镇东将军毌丘俭上言：“昔诸葛恪围合肥新城，城中遣士刘整出围〖2〗，传消息，为贼所得。考问所传，语整曰：‘诸葛公欲活汝，汝可具服〖3〗。’整骂曰：‘死狗，此何言也！我当必死为魏国鬼！不苟求活逐汝去也。欲杀我者，便速杀之！’终无他辞。又遣士郑像出城传消息。或以语恪，恪遣马骑寻围迹索，得像还。四五人的头面缚〖4〗，将绕城表。敕语像〖5〗，使大呼，言：‘大军已还洛，不如早降！’像不从其言，更大呼城中曰：‘大军近在围外，壮士努力！’贼以刀筑其口，使不得言。像遂大呼，令城中闻知。整、像为兵，能守义执节，子弟宜有差异〖6〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-2075dcee19897f7496b4","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-0f4e787b73b6486d2597","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平六年，持节，兼太常，奉法驾〖5〗，迎高贵乡公于元城。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":480,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
